### hello
GET {{host}}:{{port}}/api/hello

### user/[id]
GET {{host}}:{{port}}/api/user/{{$random.name.firstName}}?name={{$random.company.name}}

### body.post
POST {{host}}:{{port}}/api/body
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{$random.uuid}}",
  "price": {{$random.integer()}},
  "ts": {{$timestamp}},
  "value": "content"
}

### login
POST {{host}}:{{port}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "{{$random.name.firstName}}"
}

### safe （未登录时 会401）
GET {{host}}:{{port}}/api/safe

### testEnv
GET {{host}}:{{port}}/api/testEnv
